                    pts:                    `pts`,
                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (group leadership & the employee-voice representative)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Two clocks are running: 95% dispatch in 6 weeks, and 70 roles gone in 90 days. But the dispatch collapse is not a hands problem — it is two distrustful workforces refusing to cooperate while they watch your every move for a signal of who the deal favours. You cannot supervise your way out of a justice problem, and you cannot ask for sacrifice while protecting your own perks. Your modelled behaviour is the loudest message in this building. Make the people story and the operations story one story.`,

